1. Project Insight
1.1 Project Overview
VG Buildmart aims to develop a digital marketplace for construction materials,
primarily cement, stone, and TMT steel rods. The platform will connect customers,
contractors, builders, manufacturers, bulk suppliers, and transportation providers
through a centralized ordering and fulfillment system.
The platform will enable customers to purchase construction materials,
manufacturers to sell materials in bulk, and VG Buildmart to manage customer
acquisition, supplier relationships, pricing, orders, payments, and delivery
coordination.
The solution will include a customer-facing marketplace, manufacturer portal,
administrative dashboard, and transport/driver management interface.
1.2 Business ObjectivesPROJECT PROPOSAL: VG Buildmart – Construction Material Marketplace Platform2
Digital Marketplace: Establish a centralized platform for buying and selling
construction materials.
Bulk Procurement: Enable manufacturers and suppliers to offer products in
bulk quantities at negotiated prices.
Customer Acquisition: Capture leads from contractors, builders, construction
companies, and individual customers.
Order Management: Digitize the complete order lifecycle, from product
selection to delivery confirmation.
Logistics Management: Connect orders with transporters and drivers for
efficient material delivery.
Business Growth: Build a scalable platform that can expand across cities,
districts, suppliers, and construction-material categories.
Operational Transparency: Provide visibility into product prices, order status,
supplier availability, transportation costs, and delivery progress.
